 The new tail flushes but does not close the live session. It snapshots the full1000-control/8000-substep neutral prefix in a separate immutable directory, copies the still-active contact stream, and links/copies only already-flushed immutable chunks. The original standing scorer must pass all32 rows before constructing the actor. The learner then uses exactly48 policy controls/384 substeps, with no second reset or counter rebasing, for total1048 controls/8384 steps. Original native session close occurs after learning or on any failure. Every attempted policy endpoint remains available, including native errors discovered during a hold. Measurement files seal before application close; native lifecycle logs stay explicitly unsealed until the host inventories their actual post-exit bytes.
 
